{
  "id": 45,
  "description": "⭐Celestial⭐\n\nBorn from the stars.\n\nRequirements:\n- don&#039;t be inactive over a month. \n\nWe are currently not full!\n\nWe are currently accepting any player pursuing any path (When we have spots)!\n\nParticipating in raids / challenges is encouraged, but not required!\n\nAbout Us\nCelestial is a laid-back group with the intention of just playing IdleMMO! We are currently looking to build a group of casual players that enjoy playing the game. If you fit that description, we would love to have you on board!\n\nDiscord: https://discord.com/invite/DS6Pm5yrmc\n- Not a requirement! Only if you are interested in raids / announcements / general communication.\n\nIn the discord chat, we have both English and Spanish speaking members. \n\nLore:\n\nThe members of Celestial are born from fragments of the power held by celestial objects such as stars, moons and planets. It is unknown who creates these beings or how they are created, but it is said to have ties to the Old Gods.\n\nNot much is known about the group or their goal, but we can assume that they and their sudden appearance has to do with Astaroth and his sinister plan. How the group fits into this story is uncertain, but their presence is strong on Solaris Isle.",
